      "updated_at": "2018-09-12T00:21:23Z",
      "body": "Check Box is an example of a Click Wrap (Explicit agreement) versus Browser Wrap (Implied agreement). \r\n\r\nNote: \"if the user does not accept the agreement, don’t just force close or make the app quit out. Send the user back to the front page or title screen of your app to give them another opportunity to proceed if they wish.\"\r\nhttps://medium.com/ui-collection/laws-of-design-how-to-display-your-legal-agreements-in-your-mobile-app-8dd09556bd48",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
