      "created_at": "2018-09-12T01:02:22Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-09-12T01:02:22Z",
      "body": "https://privacypolicies.com/blog/gdpr-compliance-apps/\r\n\r\nIn order to comply with this requirement, your app must provide users with certain disclosures about the information you collect, as well as a checkbox, button or other means for users to actively click and confirm their consent for you to collect their data.\r\n\r\n**You cannot pre-select a consent checkbox or button, or assume that continued use of your app meets the GDPR’s requirement of acquiring active consent.**",
